  "question": {
    "text": "Total number of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo></math>&nbsp;digit numbers in which only and all the five digits <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn></math> appears, is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>As we have to make a six-digit number by using all the digits&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;hence exactly one of the digits is repeating.</p><p>For the digit to repeat we have <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>5</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math> choices.<br />And, six digits in which one is repeating&nbsp;can be arranged in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></math> ways.<br />Hence, total such numbers <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
  }
